OL,5,G1900 Ben Fogle: New Lives in the Wild
OL,6,     FRandi was the first Norwegian
OL,7,     Fwoman to climb Everest, and now
OL,8,     Fshe uses her life on a remote
OL,9,     FArctic Circle island to inspire
OL,10,     Fothers - including Ben Fogle.
OL,11,G2000 Ben Fogle: New Lives in the Wild
OL,12,     FBen journeys to Ireland's rugged
OL,13,     FAtlantic coastline to stay with
OL,14,     FJudith, a widow of 80 who rejected
OL,15,     Fa modern way of life for one
OL,16,     Fcloser to nature.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/5
