OL,5,G2300 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,6,     FDoreen begs Karen to let Ros stay
OL,7,     Fthe night, and she reluctantly
OL,8,     Fagrees. Cops tell Doreen that
OL,9,     FAlice is in hospital. Ros visits
OL,10,     Fthe brothel where her mother
OL,11,     Fworked.
OL,12,G0005 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,13,     FRos refuses to tell the police
OL,14,     Fwhere she was hiding. As Christmas
OL,15,     Fapproaches, Lizzie suggests the
OL,16,     Fwomen write their annual Christmas
OL,17,     Fplay, so Bea and Ros plan to
OL,18,     Fridicule the officers.
