OL,5,G0105 The Yorkshire Vet
OL,6,     FMatt Smith responds to a shocking
OL,7,     Femergency call after a rhea is
OL,8,     Fattacked by a pack of dogs. And
OL,9,     FDavid Melleney has an unusual
OL,10,     Fpatient - a lamb with five legs
OL,11,     Fand six feet.
OL,12,G0205 The Yorkshire Vet
OL,13,     FPeter Wright performs emergency
OL,14,     Fsurgery on a greedy spaniel with a
OL,15,     Fhistory of eating clothes. Matt
OL,16,     FSmith and Julian Norton head to
OL,17,     Fthe coast to operate on a zoo's
OL,18,     Fminiature donkey.
